00:12:30.225 --> 00:12:33.657
But there is definitely alternatives for
them like financial way and

00:12:33.657 --> 00:12:34.610
things like that.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:37.710
That's the tier that
we're trying to target,

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.090
to make sure that they have
access to that information.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:43.840
So that they know they at least have
the chance to apply to college, and

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.770
maybe qualify for financial aid and path.

00:12:50.475 --> 00:12:52.783
&gt;&gt; I'm just going to echo what
